IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `csa-census`

-- Census and Statistics Act 1905 (Cth), ss 8, 8A, 10, 11, 14, 15, 18, 19, 19A, 20, 21, 22 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_census-and-statistics-act-1905.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

