§ `s 8 -- Census years`

#ASSERT `a Census is taken in the year` 2026 FALSE
#ASSERT `a Census is taken in the year` 2031 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a Census is taken in the year` 2032 FALSE
#ASSERT `a Census is taken in the year` 2021 FALSE
#ASSERT `a Census is taken in the year` 1981 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a Census is taken in the year` 1976 FALSE
#ASSERT `a Census is taken in the year` 2032 TRUE

§ `ss 10, 11 -- which method serves which purpose`

#ASSERT `the method is available for the purpose` `a requirement by notifiable instrument under s 10(2)` `the Census under s 8`
#ASSERT NOT `the method is available for the purpose` `a requirement by notifiable instrument under s 10(2)` `statistics under s 9`
#ASSERT `the method is available for the purpose` `a direction served under s 10(4)` `statistics under s 9`
#ASSERT `the method is available for the purpose` `a request under s 11(1)` `statistics under s 9`
#ASSERT NOT `the method is available for the purpose` `no requirement, request or direction` `the Census under s 8`

