§ `s 15 -- false or misleading statements`

#ASSERT `the person commits an offence under section 15` `a requirement by notifiable instrument under s 10(2)` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the person commits an offence under section 15` `a request under s 10(3)` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits an offence under section 15` `a requirement by notifiable instrument under s 10(2)` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits an offence under section 15` `no requirement, request or direction` TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 14, 15, 19, 20 -- maximum penalties`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `failing to comply with a direction (s 14)` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `a false or misleading statement (s 15)` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `an officer divulging information, on indictment (s 19)` EQUALS 120
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in penalty units` `an officer divulging information, heard summarily (s 19, s 20(3))` EQUALS 20

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to comply with a direction (s 14)` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `an officer divulging information, on indictment (s 19)` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `an officer divulging information, heard summarily (s 19, s 20(3))` EQUALS 12

